{"v":4,"catch":"別讓光芒熄滅。","desc":"《空心燈塔》是一款以故事驅動的生存恐怖遊戲，將你拋入羅馬尼亞海岸外一座偏遠而被遺忘的島嶼。身為受派前來維修燈塔的電工，你很快便意識到——這道光芒正是守護你安全的唯一屏障。\n\n穿梭於茂密松林，攀越詭異懸崖，探索島上散落的廢棄建築。詭異身影潛伏林間，令人不安的老燈塔看守者在暗處窺視。還有某種...非人的存在...正尾隨你。\n\n越深入，黑暗越濃重。\n修復燈塔之光...在為時已晚之前。","publisher":"Fun Games Studio","release":"2025-11-13","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.0GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0350d35136f352ac6261f7ca05c8bd986f8504baa5047eebb83b500365002495.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a9f59670d4a7f85607562430a6835e6b943f34dac1e58ee38ef30f1e0f3a045f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/df2234dfe9b645b3dee52cfa577a0fda4054d587f2227b74e21ecdf9bd886682.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3d0938d64db7a143724523b9815b1e4a97663b52f1147cfad68493cad8869d19.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/800c132d18a9969173fa191cdb3cd21bb8f486fc0bfa7da0055dcb8acc56d0ca.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/92c89f14668182f9acc9c3d35946ef02c7a1925ff5a094de927ce23e7f5fc06d.jpg"],"titleId":"0100437025962000","dlc":[]}